/DeadchestPeterIsland_BVI_2.jpg/500px-DeadchestPeterIsland_BVI_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/DeadchestPeterIsland_BVI_2.jpg/500px-DeadchestPeterIsland_BVI_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dead Chest Island as viewed from Deadman's Bay, Peter Island","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADeadchestPeterIsland_BVI_2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Ycraigs_2.jpg/330px-Ycraigs_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Ycraigs_2.jpg/330px-Ycraigs_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"View of Fidra from Yellowcraigs","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYcraigs_2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Stevenson%27s_Cave.jpg/500px-Stevenson%27s_Cave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Stevenson%27s_Cave.jpg/1280px-Stevenson%27s_Cave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Stevenson%27s_Cave.jpg/500px-Stevenson%27s_Cave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\"Stevenson's Cave\" in Bridge of Allan.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStevenson's_Cave.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Admiral_Benbow._-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Admiral_Benbow._-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Admiral_Benbow._-_panoramio.jpg/1280px-Admiral_Benbow._-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaig